# ==AUTO== Automatically translated
#: src/pbpicat/ui/main_window.py:346
msgid ""
"<b>Sidecar content filter</b><br>Python regular expression applied to the "
"<i>content</i> of sidecar files.<br>Only files with at least one sidecar "
"whose content matches are shown.<br>Files with no sidecar are always hidden "
"when a filter is active.<br><tt>.*</tt> matches across line breaks (re."
"DOTALL).<br>Case-insensitive (re.IGNORECASE), including accented characters."
"<br>Leave empty to show all files."
msgstr ""
"<b>Sidecar 内容过滤器</b><br>应用于 sidecar 文件<i>内容</i>的 Python 正则表达"
"式。<br>只显示至少有一个匹配 sidecar 的文件。<br>当过滤器激活时，无 sidecar "
"的文件始终隐藏。<br><tt>.*</tt> 可跨换行符匹配 (re.DOTALL)。<br>不区分大小写 "
"(re.IGNORECASE)，包括带重音的字符。<br>留空以显示所有文件。"

